  "title": "Denmark: TotalEnergies Welcomes a Partner and Future Customer in the Bifrost CCS Project",
  "summary": "Paris, October 2, 2025 – TotalEnergies, through its affiliate TotalEnergies E&P Denmark, has entered into a Farm-Down Agreement with CarbonVault, the Danish affiliate of the German cement producer SCHWENK. Under this agreement, TotalEnergies E&P Denmark will hold a 45% interest in the Bifrost Carbon Capture and Storage (CCS) Project as the operator, alongside CarbonVault (35%) […]",
